{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":67732,\"title\":\"Woodsmith Shop\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith Shop is designed to help you get the most out of your woodworking shop with helpful tips and techniques. Whether viewers are just starting out or have been woodworking for years, they'll find something new in every episode.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2cT0MxCHTIBrZIve5hZj0nAizF.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/-A7Lr0oWhD0/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2007,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":19,\"totalEpisodes\":221,\"createdBy\":[\"Don Peschke\"],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2023-10-27\",\"cast\":[],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"-A7Lr0oWhD0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"VsPmKyrK5No\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"xS3LD46LIxw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":97655,\"title\":\"Classic Woodworking\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/goGYVomZXjqTJDLyRjLQ5TtxTEd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43529411764705883,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":61779,\"title\":\"Framework\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bd9kcH7xIdEH9q7SnD0bO2D8kBC.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4227848101265823,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":2351,\"title\":\"TransGeneration\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cckeDldsr3JCFTp5hmyNRs5eLVX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4206896551724138,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":327624,\"title\":\"The Reclaimers: Made in Suffolk\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nJAAREOpLJtULyDAPf5ngWd8y58.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42000000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":217695,\"title\":\"The Woodland Workshop\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eAJbnzDN6zemQ9fxLX26MRkiJvs.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4076923076923077,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":12,\"seasonName\":\"Season 12\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2cT0MxCHTIBrZIve5hZj0nAizF.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2018-09-11\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Setting Up Shop\",\"overview\":\"The all-new season of the Woodsmith Shop features new cast members and a look into the steps for setting up a place of your own to build project. Learn about the tools you need, the space, and ways to make your shop enjoyable and safe. You’ll also hear the stories for the cast’s first workshops.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-11\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Gentleman's Dresser Part 1\",\"overview\":\"While it was designed as a bedroom dresser, this Craftsman project would look great in almost any room of the house. It features solid wood construction and plenty of storage options. This week on the Woodsmith Shop, you’ll learn how to make a strong and sturdy case.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Gentleman's Dresser Part 2\",\"overview\":\"Wrapping up this classic Craftsman storage piece, Woodsmith Shop team tackles the frame and panel doors that feature art glass panels. A dovetailed drawer and some trays add versatile storage options. Finally, learn the steps to creating an arts and crafts finish.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-25\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Puzzle Boxes\",\"overview\":\"These small boxes teach big woodworking lessons. Inspired by Japanese puzzle boxes, the Woodsmith Shop cast turn to a router table to make precise joinery cuts in small pieces. These boxes are a delight to open, fun to build, and ideal to give as gifts.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-02\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Kitchen Cart\",\"overview\":\"Most kitchens could use a little more storage. The Woodsmith Shop dives in to a compact cart that has a big impact. Learn about plywood construction and how to make a cutting board top. We’ll wrap things up with a painted finish that’s durable and looks great.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-09\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Weekend Workbench\",\"overview\":\"A good workbench sits at the center of most workshops. Follow along as the Woodsmith Shop crew build a surprisingly simple bench design. Made from common construction lumber, plywood, and unique top, you can build one in a weekend.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Router Joinery\",\"overview\":\"Join the Woodsmith Shop team as they build two jigs that turn a basic router into a woodworking joint making powerhouse. First up is a mortising jig that improves speed and accuracy. The second jig creates box joints that are not only strong, but eye-catching, too.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-13\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Flag Case\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith Shop woodworkers take some time to honor those who’ve served and sacrificed for the country by building a memorial flag case. The project starts with a basic case, but also offers a display lid for medals and memorabilia as well as a stand to create a focal-point tribute.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-20\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Craftsman Rocker\",\"overview\":\"The cozy comforts of a well-made rocking chair are perfect for relaxing. Follow along as the crew in the Woodsmith Shop make a classic oak rocker that’s sure to become an instant heirloom. Learn the tips and techniques for making curved and angled parts with common woodworking tools.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-27\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Compact Router Table\",\"overview\":\"The cozy comforts of a well-made rocking chair are perfect for relaxing. Follow along as the crew in the Woodsmith Shop make a classic oak rocker that’s sure to become an instant heirloom. Learn the tips and techniques for making curved and angled parts with common woodworking tools.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-04\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Threaded Lid Canisters\",\"overview\":\"All-new canisters are the next project tackled by the Woodsmith Shop woodworkers. A unique router jig allows you to create threads in wood. Learn how a drill press technique and a router form the round canisters without the use of the lathe.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-11\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Top-Notch Finishing\",\"overview\":\"Watch as the Woodsmith Shop crew shows you the details for applying their favorite, go-to finishing techniques. You’re sure to learn new ways to give your wood projects the final touch. And you’ll discover great tips to make the process enjoyable and stress-free.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Workshop Tips & Tricks\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith Shop team wrap up the season with a series of tips and tricks segments covering a range of woodworking topics along with a few handy hints for getting great results.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-25\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2007-10-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}